    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>s3.trajectory-playhead</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\term{position}{p}=\\term{interpolate}{I}(\\term{start}{a},\\term{end}{b},\\term{fraction}{t}),\\quad \\term{speed}{v}=\\begin{cases}\\term{length}{d}(\\term{start}{a},\\term{end}{b})/\\term{duration}{\\Delta t}&amp;\\term{status}{s}=\\text{active},\\term{duration}{\\Delta t}&gt;0\\\\0&amp;\\text{otherwise}\\end{cases}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">For a nonempty track, p=I(a,b,t); speed=d(a,b)/duration only when active with positive duration, otherwise 0. I is linear interpolation in planar mode or spherical interpolation with continuous longitude. Binary search picks the latest duplicate row; t is the clamped elapsed-time fraction, held at 0 in a gap and at the endpoint outside the span. Empty tracks output zeros.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-playhead-compiled:trajectory-playhead-geometry\" data-value=\"position\">position · output · currentPositions</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-playhead-compiled:trajectory-playhead-geometry\" data-value=\"speed\">speed · output · speeds</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-playhead-compiled:trajectory-playhead-geometry\" data-value=\"start\">start · input · startPosition</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-trajectory-playhead-compiled:trajectory-play